'''Memory Light''' (Japanese: '''メモリーライト''' ''Memory Light'') is a {{TCGP|Pokémon Tool}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Secluded Springs}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Tool
|rule=Pocket Tool
|effect=The Pokémon this card is attached to can use any attack from its previous Evolutions. ''(You still need the necessary Energy to use each attack.)''
}}

==Trivia==
* Upon release, while Memory Light would allow {{TCG ID|Space-Time Smackdown|Starly|132}}'s Evolutions to use its Pluck attack, the attack would fail to remove the opponent's attached {{TCGP|Pokémon Tool}}. This was identified as a bug in an in-game notice published on September 10, 2025.<ref name="MemoryLightNotices" />
* This card's effect is identical to that of the {{TCG|Memory Capsule}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]].

